      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprises working with a GitHub or Microsoft account team can now get Copilot included with GitHub Enterprise for every licensed user.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Previously, you had to manage two things: how many Copilot seats you were paying for and how much AI usage those users consumed.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Copilot included in the platform, usage against your enterprise budget is the primary thing to manage.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Business and Copilot Enterprise remain available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Users in your enterprise account who do not hold a GitHub Enterprise license get the same Copilot access through Copilot Standalone, at $10 per user per month.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot access through GitHub Enterprise and Copilot Standalone has the same features and models as Copilot Enterprise but does not include monthly AI credits per seat.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Chat, Copilot code review, and Copilot in the cloud require available budget to use.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you work with a GitHub or Microsoft account team: Available now for GitHub Enterprise Cloud.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Talk to your sales team about setting up a new enterprise account on this model or transitioning an existing enterprise account.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:50:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:00.018Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Business and Copilot Enterprise: Both remain available to purchase for new and existing enterprises.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-enterprise-now-includes-access-to-github-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
